# The ranges the action accepts. The action installs requirements.txt, which
# is compiled from this file with exact versions and hashes; Dependabot keeps
# it up to date within these ranges and never changes them (see README).
#
# Major versions are capped on purpose: adopt cfn-lint 2 / cfn-lint-ax 2 by
# bumping both lines here.
#
# cfn-lint is also held below 1.59: 1.59.0 refuses `append_rules` and
# `output_file` in a .cfnlintrc it discovers. The action now passes the
# cfn-lint-ax rules itself; the cap goes once repositories using the action
# have dropped both from their .cfnlintrc.
cfn-lint>=1.57.2,<1.59
cfn-lint-ax>=1.4.2,<2
